  "description": "Using C# code to write front-end effects in a WPF project? This sounds crazy, but this library can help you. It not only has a completely independent transition system, but also has support for source code generators of the MVVM design pattern. For back-end developers, this can greatly reduce the learning cost of XAML. And you know, the C# syntax is concise and elegant.",
